      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Marcus sounds like a typical street-smart archetype, and Elena is the classic wealthy socialite, both leaning heavily into familiar roles. Kenji and Andre are a bit vague, but Julian is the textbook old-money operator. I think Marcus and Andre would fit a gritty crime drama, while Elena and Julian are perfect for a high-society prestige drama.",
      "source": "target",
